# Template for local environment variables. Copy to .dev.vars and fill in real
# values — .dev.vars is gitignored.
#
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# Local development and tests need no secrets at all: D1, R2 and KV are
# simulated by miniflare, migrations are applied through wrangler, and
# drizzle-kit only generates SQL without connecting to anything.
#
# The variables below are needed once you deploy. Uncomment and fill them in:

# Stripe payments
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Admin session signing key (generate with: openssl rand -base64 32)
# SESSION_SECRET=

# From address for transactional email
# MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=

# Theme, resolved at build time. Leave empty for the default.
# Ships with two: "default" (technical, hairline borders, catalogue-first) and
# "editorial" (serif, warm paper, soft shadows, application-notes-first).
# To add your own: copy a theme directory under a new name, rename its scope
# class in tokens.css and layout/Shell.tsx to match, register it in
# src/themes/registry.ts, then put that name here.
THEME=
